also hellholes and wyrm caerns that aren't necessary subterranean but maybe i am remmebering bad... age sigh...<br /> <br /> if that's the case, of course drones and fly would be useless, and instead the Void engineers subterranean group spec ops will take the lead. Armored machines and carefully manufactured robots and cyborgs will probably be empolyed that can simply travel trhough matter or spirit with Spirit, matter or correspondence procedures.<br /> <br /> Of course these machines will be also enhanced to be ultra resistant to agg damage and spirits and banes and gifts powers (dimensional science+prime+matter) and probably extra warded with additional protection.<br /> <br /> Sure, the snipers will be almost useless in a subterrenean setting..<br /> <br /> I'm not sure about technocratic explosions and dimensional bombing though.. i get it that toxic and chemicals help the wyrm and everything... but from a bsd perspective how would that exactly help them if they suffer 40 levels of aggravated damage in a single turn?<br /> <br /> guess banes and wyrm spawn will then flourish from the nuke waste, but as far sa shapeshifter goes... they will be blasted to pieces.<br /> <br /> Anyway, i see what u mean and of course even if the bsd would be wiped out, spirits and banes will probably infest the hellhole.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4247-lasombra","name":"Lasombra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4247_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"179"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-25T10:00:50-07:00","id":1133842,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\